    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property are delighted to bring No. 11 Clos Derdriu to the market for sale. A substantial 4-bedroom detached residence extending to c. 135sqm / 1,453 sq ft, offered for sale and an opportunity to live in one of County Louth's most desirable seaside villages.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a home in the highly sought-after The Ferns development and a blank canvas ready to create a super new home to your own exacting standards. \r\n\r\nNo. 11 offers versatile, family accommodation set over two floors with ample space to extend (SPP). Today it requires full modernisation - tomorrow it could be your dream coastal home. \r\n\r\nFor viewing contact Blue Sky Property Dundalk - 042 932 9333 - Serving Your Property Needs. Guide Price €475,000. \r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nThe Ferns is nestled in the heart of the upmarket seaside village of Blackrock, Co. Louth, one of County Louth's most desirable seaside villages, moments away from Blackrock promenade looking out on Dundalk Bay. \r\n\r\nSituated within a quiet, mature cul-de-sac that is only a stone's throw from the village's main street, No. 11 has all local amenities within strolling distance.\r\n\r\nBlackrock is a stroller's paradise, complete with tranquil beach promenade passing shops, bars, restaurants, an 18 hole golf course, a busy community centre and 2 national schools.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated on a prime site in a quiet cul de sac, with Blackrock beach promenade and Blackrock Park within walking distance. Blackrock is a vibrant seaside village which benefits from a welcoming selection of family friendly amenities including schools and sports facilities alongside the beach promenade which boasts views of Dundalk Bay & the Cooley Mountains. There is a real sense of community in the area and purchasers will enjoy the laid back feel this village offers.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 2.41m x 1.86m\r\nLiving Room: 3.94m x 5.4m\r\nKitchen: 5.23m x 4.24m\r\nSunroom: 3.04m x 4.10m\r\nUtility: 1.86m x 2.09m, 2.31m x 1.13m\r\nHallway: 2.06m x 6.35m\r\nBedroom One: 3.35m x 3.78m\r\nBedroom Two: 2.70m x 2.89m\r\nBathroom: 2.7m x 2.28m\r\n\r\nLanding: 0.90m x 2.55m\r\nBedroom Three: 2.89m x 5.57m\r\nBedroom Four: 3.99m x 3.88m\r\nEn-Suite: 2.38m x 1.88m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Seafront Living : 200m to Blackrock promenade, beach & park\r\nVillage Lifestyle : Speciality shops, cafes, restaurants, bars, all within 2 minute stroll\r\nFamily Perfect : 2 national schools, community centre, sports clubs, Dundalk Golf Club on your doorstep\r\nCommuter Connected : Convenient to M1 Motorway Junction 16/17, providing easy access for commuters to both Dublin & Belfast City. Dundalk Clarke Train Station & Bus Eireann depot minutes away.\r\n135sqm detached on mature, enclosed site with off-street parking - offering versatile, family accommodation, with ample space to extend (spp)*"
      },
